/*
 * Explicit template solving for variable-based template parameters.
 *
 * TemplateExplicitOfVarSolving is the central module responsible for
 * resolving template parameters of the form:
 *
 *     T of X
 *     T impl X
 *     T over X
 *
 * where:
 *   - `of`   enforces direct type matching,
 *   - `impl` enforces trait implementation constraints,
 *   - `over` enforces class inheritance constraints.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::template_::solve::explicit::ofvar
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/template_/solve/explicit/ofvar.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-06-13
